hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27919","Muhammad ibn Ubayd Allah narrated to us, he said: Muhammad ibn Ishaq narrated to us, from a man of the Ansar, from his mother Salma bint Qays, she said: I pledged the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, among women of the Ansar. She said: Among what he took upon us was that we not deceive our husbands. She said: When we left, we said: By Allah, if only we had asked the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, what is deceiving our husbands. She said: So we returned and asked him. He said: That you favor, or give as a gift with his wealth, another than him."
